	)
	(text "At 80 V maximum voltage, aim for voltage divider to produce 2 V.\n2 / 80 = 0.025 ratio\nFixing top resistor at 1 MOhm\nBottom resistor = 0.025 x 1 Mohm = 25 k\n\n25.5 k is closest value. This will cap the range slightly below 80 V.\n\n1 nF capacitor for minimal low pass filtering."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 79.502 42.926 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a0e563fb-537a-4604-a0ea-976089c000a1")
	)
	(text "Stored energy: 0.5 CV^2\n0.5 * 45u * 80^2 = 0.144 J\nDischarge time constant: RC\n~ 1M * 47u = 45 seconds"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 28.702 79.756 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "a8ab570f-b2ed-4891-8c43-e842334d2490")
	)
